  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>DV_Monster_Tusktroll</defName>
    <label>ogre</label>
    <description>The larger, meaner and smarter cousin of the common northern troll. Ogres, unlike their cousins, are solitary creatures, preferring to live alone in ruins to brood.n/n/Ogres are only found outside of their hideouts during mating season, where they're exceptionally rowdy.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>550</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-25</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ArmorRating_Heat>-2</ArmorRating_Heat>
      <InjuryHealingFactor>2.5</InjuryHealingFactor>
      <Flammability>2</Flammability>
      <EatingSpeed>1.5</EatingSpeed>
      <Wildness>0.80</Wildness>
      <FilthRate>8</FilthRate>
